{"id":69780,"date":"2025-10-25T11:33:52","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T10:33:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69780"},"modified":"2026-10-28T09:35:36","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T08:35:36","slug":"maratona-de-chicago","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-chicago\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Chicago 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Chicago 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Chicago 2027<\/strong> (49\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o, oficialmente <em>Bank of America Chicago Marathon 2027<\/em>) realiza-se no dia <strong>10 de Outubro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida e meta no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Grant Park<\/strong> (Columbus Drive e Roosevelt Road), em <strong>Chicago, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Integrada no prestigiado circuito mundial <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong>, a prova norte-americana \u00e9 c\u00e9lebre pelo seu tra\u00e7ado circular, plano e ultra-r\u00e1pido atrav\u00e9s de <strong>29 bairros hist\u00f3ricos de Chicago<\/strong>, onde foram estabelecidos os atuais recordes mundiais de maratona masculino (2:00:35) e feminino (2:09:56).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O fim de semana desportivo arranca no s\u00e1bado, <strong>9 de Outubro de 2027<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>07:30<\/strong> (cadeiras de rodas \u00e0s 07:25), com a <strong>Abbott Chicago 5K (5 km)<\/strong>, que parte do Grant Park (Ida B. Wells Drive) e percorre o cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <em>Downtown Chicago<\/em> (<em>The Loop<\/em>) at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta na Michigan Avenue. No domingo, <strong>10 de Outubro de 2027<\/strong>, os <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> iniciam-se com as divis\u00f5es profissionais de <strong>Cadeiras de Rodas<\/strong> (07:20 e 07:21), <strong>Handcycle<\/strong> (07:23) e <strong>Elite Profissional<\/strong> (07:30), seguindo-se tr\u00eas vagas gerais de partida: <strong>Vaga 1<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07:35<\/strong> (Corrais A a E), <strong>Vaga 2<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> (Corrais F a J) e <strong>Vaga 3<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:35<\/strong> (Corrais K a N).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O per\u00edodo de candidatura ao <strong>sorteio oficial (Non-Guaranteed Drawing)<\/strong> e \u00e0s <strong>entradas garantidas<\/strong> para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 decorre de <strong>8 a 29 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com notifica\u00e7\u00e3o dos resultados do sorteio a <strong>8 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>. A taxa oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na maratona \u00e9 de <strong>260 USD<\/strong> para atletas internacionais (<strong>250 USD<\/strong> para residentes nos EUA), existindo igualmente entrada garantida por <strong>tempo de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (Time Qualifier)<\/strong>, estatuto <em>Legacy Finisher<\/em> (5+ conclus\u00f5es entre 2017 e 2026), operadores tur\u00edsticos internacionais oficiais e programa solid\u00e1rio (<em>Charity Program<\/em>). O levantamento presencial do dorsal decorre na <strong>Abbott Health &amp; Fitness Expo<\/strong>, no centro de conven\u00e7\u00f5es <strong>McCormick Place<\/strong>, de 7 a 9 de outubro de 2027.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15p